This plugin bundles a modified Mozilla PDF.js runtime (Apache-2.0),
snapshot commit c80e5a952 on branch windows, with underline and square
annotation editors and the 1-5 tool shortcuts.
PDF.js is Copyright Mozilla Foundation and its contributors.

All PDF.js, font, character-map, image-decoder and colour-library license
texts shipped in vendor/pdfjs-generic-legacy are preserved in the embedded
Viewer payload and in the extracted runtime resources. Consult those
individual license texts for their terms and attribution notices.
